1
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:34,040
The battle is imminent.

2
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,400
Guo Zijian, let me tell you,

3
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,400
if it weren't for the Political Commissar,

4
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:38,840
I would strip you of your command.

5
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,160
Deputy Brigade Commander.

6
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:43,160
If I've hurt your pride,

7
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:44,600
I apologize.

8
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,880
But I hope you can

9
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,360
seriously consider my suggestion.

10
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:53,760
Fine.

11
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,320
Let me tell you,

12
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,080
you are not the Chief of Staff of the 396th Brigade,

13
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:00,000
nor are you a recon squad leader.

14
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,240
Your post

15
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:02,560
is in the 1st Battalion.

16
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:04,600
Get back to your post.

17
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,440
Yes, sir.

18
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,760
Guo Zijian

19
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:24,360
You stop right there!

20
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:24,920
Stop!

21
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:30,040
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo outranks you.

22
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,480
You need to watch your attitude.

23
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,000
Political Commissar.

24
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,600
Wars aren't fought with attitudes.

25
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:34,760
Even if wars aren't fought with attitudes,

26
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:36,600
but a bad attitude causes internal damage.

27
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:37,640
How you feel,

28
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:38,600
we all understand.

29
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,520
But the battle is about to start.

30
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,800
Are we to change the entire deployment?

31
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,280
There's no time for that.

32
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:44,880
Political Commissar.

33
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:47,040
In modern warfare, once a chance appears,

34
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,760
we can immediately use suppressive fire.

35
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,000
How could there not be enough time?

36
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,080
To tell you the truth,

37
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,960
you never intended to fight a real battle.

38
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:53,360
Guo Zijian!

39
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,280
What kind of talk is that?

40
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,320
Am I wrong?

41
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,320
This exercise is a great opportunity,

42
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,040
but all you leaders have in your heads are

43
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,000
exercise directives,

44
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,600
grading standards and exercise rules.

45
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,600
No wonder Deputy Brigade Commander fumed.

46
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,840
What are you saying?

47
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:06,520
The truth.

48
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:08,320
You're fighting a battle for scores,

49
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:09,040
for spreadsheets.

50
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,960
It's not a life-and-death battle.

51
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,120
Guo Zijian!

52
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,960
Sorry, Political Commissar. I was rash.

53
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:19,600
Guo Zijian.

54
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,040
At the academy, you were always engaged in

55
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,600
combat research.

56
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,800
Force-on-force exercises must have rules,

57
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,640
Is it wrong to have rules?

58
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,680
Political Commissar.

59
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:31,560
Having rules isn't wrong.

60
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,760
But relying solely on those rules

61
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:34,600
that is wrong.

62
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:35,400
Fine, let me ask you.

63
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,720
Even if we adjust our combat deployment,

64
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,920
we still need a target, right?

65
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,520
You said their command post is fake.

66
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,600
Then where is the real one?

67
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,360
Captain Zeng,

68
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:48,400
do me a favor.

69
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:56,720
What do you mean?

70
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,680
Didn't you say to let the data speak?

71
00:03:58,920 --> 00:03:59,640
This location

72
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,520
is both hidden and remote.

73
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:03,160
Based on all the data,

74
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,120
it perfectly matches

75
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,960
the Blue Force command post requirements.

76
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:08,840
You think it's at Yellow Stone Ridge?

77
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:10,880
Can you be sure?

78
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:12,960
Without on-site reconnaissance,

79
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,320
I can't make a final judgment.

80
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,560
We need to go take a look.

81
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:17,440
Just in case my speculation is right,

82
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:18,720
if we miss this opportunity

83
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,399
and choose the wrong target to strike,

84
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,640
it's highly likely that we

85
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:22,800
will lose this battle.

86
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:24,480
But Guo Zijian,

87
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,040
do you know what time it is?

88
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,240
You're the main attack Battalion Commander.

89
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,960
The 1st Battalion's combat mission

90
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:30,960
cannot afford any delays.

91
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:33,160
You want to go to Yellow Stone Ridge now?

92
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,680
Are you kidding me?

93
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,320
Political Commissar.

94
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,800
I can't go.

95
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:37,960
But someone can.

96
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:47,560
Battalion Commander Guo.

97
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,080
Our reconnaissance detachment

98
00:04:49,200 --> 00:04:50,520
is assigned to the 396th Brigade.

99
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:52,920
We only answer to the brigade leaders.

100
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,240
Besides,

101
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,160
since you felt our recon results

102
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,440
were just armchair strategy,

103
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,120
why bother with this unnecessary move?

104
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,440
I was wrong.

105
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,560
I apologize to you.

106
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:05,000
You are not armchair strategists.

107
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,680
You are scientific elites.

108
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,760
Comrade Zeng Muhan.

109
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,920
I'll have to trouble you

110
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:12,600
to make the trip.

111
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:14,720
Yes, sir.

112
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,520
Once you reach the reconnaissance area,

113
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,280
please contact me on a dedicated line.

114
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:18,960
Yes, sir.

115
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:19,880
Hurry back to the 1st Battalion.

116
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,120
Yes, sir.

117
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:28,960
Recon detachment, attention!

118
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,000
Grab your gear.

119
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,280
Move out immediately!

120
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:32,000
Yes, sir!

121
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:41,600
Battalion Commander.

122
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:43,320
Was everything we did tonight

123
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,680
all for nothing?

124
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,200
What do you mean, for nothing?

125
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,600
The group army's recon detachment

126
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,760
have already moved out, right?

127
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,600
Is Zeng Muhan up to it?

128
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,560
After all, West Wind Valley

129
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,040
was the target they gave us.

130
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,800
All we can do now

131
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,120
is head back and make

132
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,360
full preparations for an attack.

133
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,000
If the target changes,

134
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,440
we'll be ready to respond.

135
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:07,840
Yes, sir.

136
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,160
In a tiny place like this,

137
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,760
setting up camp for the command center

138
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:31,080
must be a downgrade for you, Commander.

139
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:32,400
As long as we can win the battle,

140
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:34,960
even a toilet-sized space will do.

141
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,960
Keep the Laohukou backup command post?

142
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,920
Did I say it was a backup?

143
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:44,840
A so-called command center

144
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,080
is just some command equipment,

145
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,600
a group of staff officers,

146
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,120
and a bunch of support personnel.

147
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,400
Wherever I, Long Yuanshan, am,

148
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,640
is the command center.

149
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,160
Battalion Commander.

150
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,720
Is that true?

151
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,040
Inside intel.

152
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,200
Absolutely reliable.

153
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,600
A leopard can't change its spots.

154
00:07:23,960 --> 00:07:24,760
At a time like this,

155
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:26,400
Guo Zijian is still trying to show off?

156
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,520
Yeah.

157
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:28,920
I heard that

158
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,360
if the Political Commissar wasn't there,

159
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,600
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo wanted to

160
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,280
sack him on the spot.

161
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,120
No.

162
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,360
Get Xu Dali here.

163
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,160
Yes, sir.

164
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:43,720
Map.

165
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:48,160
Deputy Brigade Commander.

166
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,880
What's the rush?

167
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,320
Guo Zijian just

168
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,720
reported a new situation.

169
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:56,080
He led men to reconnoiter

170
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,040
the Blue Force command post again.

171
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,960
He found that this command post

172
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:01,040
is very likely a fake.

173
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,240
The command post is a core stronghold.

174
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,160
We sent two recon teams,

175
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,400
and both returned unscathed,

176
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,960
yet reached different conclusions.

177
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:11,160
This

178
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,520
is indeed quite abnormal.

179
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,080
Although Guo Zijian is a bit unreliable,

180
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,080
at this critical juncture,

181
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,240
he wouldn't just talk nonsense.

182
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,760
Then what do you think we should do?

183
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,280
Have the 3rd and 4th Battalions,

184
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,520
and most of the Firepower Battalion,

185
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,440
assemble along the Shigun River.

186
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,320
Prepare

187
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,760
to strike Jade Emperor Peak.

188
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,080
The 2nd Battalion will mobilize,

189
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:36,520
and the reserve forces

190
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:37,760
will stand by.

191
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,440
But based on the current situation,

192
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,679
Jade Emperor Peak is very likely

193
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,080
a decoy set by the Blue Force

194
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,240
to distract us.

195
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:49,600
The reason they're playing these tricks

196
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,280
is actually to figure out

197
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,720
our troop deployment.

198
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,400
We can

199
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:55,760
use their trick against them.

200
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,120
Concentrate our firepower

201
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:58,440
and take Jade Emperor Peak

202
00:08:59,000 --> 00:08:59,920
to score the first point.

203
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:02,320
Then occupy favorable terrain,

204
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:04,240
take the initiative,

205
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:06,680
and move the fight to Jade Emperor Peak.

206
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:07,760
This way,

207
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,480
we can advance or retreat.

208
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,120
It will be much easier

209
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,480
to wipe out the enemy's main force later.

210
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,600
Report to Political Commissar Kang?

211
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,480
I'll brief him personally later.

212
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,520
Hurry up and deploy the troops.

213
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:20,400
Yes, sir.

214
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,240
What about the 1st Battalion?

215
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,720
They'll act according to the original plan.

216
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,280
I know what you want to say.

217
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,480
But think about it,

218
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,640
the 1st Battalion is our

219
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,560
main attack battalion.

220
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,440
Only by striking the target as planned

221
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,200
can we confuse Long Yuanshan.

222
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,120
Understand?

223
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:55,120
That's our main attack battalion's role.

224
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:01,840
Report!

225
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,560
Xu Dali, come here.

226
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:06,000
Your orders, Battalion Commander?

227
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:07,840
Once the battle begins,

228
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:09,760
leave your original standby area,

229
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,960
and move towards the brigade command post.

230
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,080
Why?

231
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,360
Don't ask why.

232
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,400
Take your attached firepower.

233
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:17,120
I'll assign the brigade's long-range fire

234
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:17,720
assigned to you as well.

235
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,480
But they have their own defense forces.

236
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:20,200
Xu Dali.

237
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,960
Ensuring the brigade command post's safety

238
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,360
is our battalion's mission anyway.

239
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:26,440
Understood?

240
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:27,360
Understood.

241
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,320
I'll go arrange it right now.

242
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:34,160
This Guo Zijian is going too far.

243
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,600
He's just a Battalion Commander.

244
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,720
A petty little officer.

245
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:39,000
Calling our recon unit worthless.

246
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:40,240
Why should we listen to him?

247
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,640
This mission

248
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:42,760
was given by the Political Commissar

249
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:43,800
personally.

250
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,200
Isn't it all the same?

251
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:46,680
That's enough.

252
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:48,480
All we need to do

253
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:49,640
is obey orders

254
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,600
and complete the mission.

255
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:51,560
Yes.

256
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,920
The Battalion Commander is worried about

257
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:00,840
Long Yuanshan's decapitation tactic.

258
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,080
The decapitation tactic

259
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:07,160
has always been Long Yuanshan's style.

260
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:10,120
Though that kid Guo Zijian acts crazy,

261
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,280
maybe

262
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,000
he really did discover something.

263
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,440
We have to keep something in reserve

264
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,400
just in case.

265
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:25,440
Report!

266
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:27,600
Battalion Commander!

267
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,080
There's an adjustment to our combat plan.

268
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:31,800
Speak.

269
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,400
Our main firepower

270
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,520
will strike Jade Emperor Peak.

271
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:35,920
Our 1st Battalion

272
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:38,360
will continue to strike the original target.

273
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:45,640
Then they...

274
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,360
What exactly does this mean?

275
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:50,200
They only half-believe my conclusion,

276
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:53,480
so they chose the safest approach.

277
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,440
Any news from Zeng Muhan?

278
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,000
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

279
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,160
We haven't received any signals from the

280
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:01,080
reconnaissance unit.

281
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,560
At this time,

282
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,320
panicking won't solve the problem.

283
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,720
Let's patiently wait a bit longer.

284
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,480
They realized the target was incorrect.

285
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,560
Then why mobilize the main force

286
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:28,280
towards Jade Emperor Peak?

287
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:30,920
Fools!

288
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,480
Sir, please calm down.

289
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:35,920
Don't you always say

290
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:38,080
that exercises are about finding problems?

291
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,080
That the more problems exposed,

292
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,600
the deeper the lessons learned?

293
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,480
Haven't we seen enough of this?

294
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,560
How many units have learned their lesson?

295
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,640
If things keep going like this,

296
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:49,120
we'll have to change the exercise rules.

297
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:52,000
But, sir,

298
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,720
these are just small-scale skirmishes.

299
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:56,640
The real show

300
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,720
is yet to come.

301
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,040
Right?

302
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:48,440
Zijian.

303
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,760
It'll be dawn soon.

304
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,120
Our battalion is firing

305
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:56,160
the first shot of the brigade's offensive.

306
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:01,960
You don't need to remind me of that.

307
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,720
I know the weight of this shot.

308
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,120
Up until now,

309
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,680
there's been no news from Zeng Muhan.

310
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,200
At a time like this,

311
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:17,080
we absolutely cannot

312
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:19,640
change the operational plan on our own.

313
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:22,960
The brigade command post just sent someone.

314
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,720
Time and time again,

315
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:26,360
they say we must obey discipline.

316
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,760
Emphasizing discipline at this juncture...

317
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,520
It's aimed right at me, Guo Zijian.

318
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:33,760
Don't I know that?

319
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,760
As soldiers,

320
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,720
aren't we supposed to obey orders?

321
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:41,880
Fine, we'll do it your way.

322
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:46,640
Guo Zijian.

323
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,720
Inside that head of yours,

324
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:53,840
what scheme are you cooking up now?

325
00:14:55,680 --> 00:14:57,200
You shouldn't have agreed so quickly.

326
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:00,520
The faster you agree,

327
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:03,800
the more worried I get.

328
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:30,200
Use the multi-function recon device

329
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:32,040
to observe the woods 300 meters ahead.

330
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:52,720
We're not waiting anymore.

331
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:53,560
Notify Wu Dongsheng

332
00:15:53,560 --> 00:15:54,760
to come to the command post immediately.

333
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:55,480
Yes, sir.

334
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:58,320
Wu Dongsheng and the entire recon squad

335
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,160
are standing by.

336
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:01,240
Worthy of our 1st Battalion recon leader.

337
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,640
The battle is about to start,

338
00:16:02,760 --> 00:16:03,640
but we still haven't received

339
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:05,000
any news from the army group's recon unit.

340
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:06,080
Your mission is

341
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:08,240
to scout the Yellow Stone Ridge area.

342
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:09,680
We will accomplish the mission!

343
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:10,360
Wu Dongsheng,

344
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,280
wait a moment.

345
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,680
I need to discuss this with the Commander.

346
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:13,720
The window of opportunity is fleeting.

347
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,120
There's no time to discuss.

348
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:15,680
Wu Dongsheng.

349
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:16,240
Yes, sir!

350
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:16,960
Step outside.

351
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,280
I know

352
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:20,920
you're worried about Yellow Stone Ridge.

353
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:22,800
But the main assault is about to begin.

354
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,840
We can't afford any mistakes right now.

355
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:27,040
The army group sent out their recon unit.

356
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:27,920
Even in the worst case,

357
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,440
even if something goes wrong

358
00:16:29,440 --> 00:16:30,320
and delays the battle,

359
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:32,280
it has nothing to do with you, Guo Zijian.

360
00:16:32,280 --> 00:16:33,800
I don't like the sound of that.

361
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:36,480
I never just settle for avoiding blame.

362
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:37,720
I want to win the battle.

363
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:39,080
If a commander has doubts about a target,

364
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,240
shouldn't they conduct reconnaissance?

365
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:43,000
I understand your intentions are good.

366
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,560
But doing this...

367
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:43,920
Fine, fine, fine.

368
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:44,880
I can never win an argument with you.

369
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,840
Just let me have this one, okay?

370
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,000
If anything happens,

371
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,200
I, Guo Zijian, will take responsibility.

372
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:49,920
I won't drag you down.

373
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:51,200
What do you mean you won't drag me down?

374
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:53,160
We're already in the same boat.

375
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:55,840
If things go wrong, we share the blame.

376
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:56,640
Alright.

377
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:58,480
Wu Dongsheng.

378
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,280
Yes, sir!

379
00:16:59,360 --> 00:17:00,080
Move out!

380
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:01,040
Yes, sir.

381
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:12,440
It's over

382
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:13,440
What's wrong?

383
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,760
We've been ambushed.

384
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:17,319
Freeze!

385
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:18,839
Don't move!

386
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:25,640
Looks like Guo Zijian was right.

387
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:27,280
I'll hold them off for a while.

388
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:28,560
Hurry up and transmit the coordinates!

389
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:38,320
Alright.

390
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,320
Stop whispering.

391
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:43,360
None of you are getting away.

392
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:44,880
You talk big.

393
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:45,800
How would we know without a fight?

394
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,840
Anyone trying to run

395
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,160
will be shot dead.

396
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:50,880
Anyone wanting to fight,

397
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:52,400
we'll fight you to the end.

398
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:53,400
Count off!

399
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:53,800
One!

400
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:54,160
Two!

401
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:54,440
Three!

402
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:54,720
Four!

403
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,160
Five!

404
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:55,480
Six!

405
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:55,840
Seven!

406
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:56,560
All present!

407
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:57,320
Huzi!

408
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:57,920
Here!

409
00:17:58,120 --> 00:17:58,760
Shaolong!

410
00:17:58,760 --> 00:17:59,280
Here!

411
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:00,120
Shunzi!

412
00:18:00,120 --> 00:18:00,680
Here!

413
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:03,160
Switch to the Liebao for disguised recon.

414
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,040
Yes, Sir!

415
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,320
Squad Leader,

416
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:07,000
They're all my own.

417
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:08,320
You can't play favorites.

418
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:08,920
Squad Leader,

419
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:09,840
let everyone go.

420
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:11,080
Even a hero needs helpers.

421
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,960
Stop pushing your luck.

422
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:14,160
The rest of you,

423
00:18:14,400 --> 00:18:15,720
hurry back and get some sleep.

424
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,520
Squad Leader, take me with you.

425
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:19,400
You'll need a tough fighter anyway, right?

426
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:20,160
That's enough.

427
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:21,600
Didn't you hear the Squad Leader?

428
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:23,480
Scouts need to use their brains.

429
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:25,160
Stop talking about fighting all the time.

430
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:26,800
Wu Dongsheng!

431
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:28,800
Wu Dongsheng!

432
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:30,040
Political Instructor.

433
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:35,720
It's dark and the path is treacherous.

434
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:37,560
Make sure to stay safe.

435
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:39,160
Yes, Sir!

436
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,880
I'll make sure to be careful.

437
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,360
Awaiting your triumphant return.

438
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:49,000
I guarantee the mission will be complete!

439
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:06,080
Nice moves.

440
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:35,960
Take him away.

441
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:38,440
Move.

442
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,240
Staff Officer Liang.

443
00:19:57,600 --> 00:19:59,520
Why aren't they in a recon vehicle?

444
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,520
Under special circumstances,

445
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:03,360
they can use appropriate vehicles

446
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:04,760
to conduct disguised reconnaissance.

447
00:20:05,080 --> 00:20:07,080
You think tracking a recon team right now

448
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,960
makes us penny wise, pound foolish?

449
00:20:11,280 --> 00:20:12,200
Don't worry.

450
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:15,240
Their normal offensive operations here

451
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:16,760
are all going according to plan.

452
00:20:17,240 --> 00:20:18,680
I requested this from Exercise Control.

453
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,120
They will send a recorder over.

454
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:21,680
When the time comes, they will provide us

455
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:22,920
with fully detailed footage.

456
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:23,880
No.

457
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,760
Staff Officer Liang, it's about to start.

458
00:20:25,760 --> 00:20:26,480
What kind of trouble can one recon team

459
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:27,640
even stir up?

460
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,920
This is what Exercise Control wants.

461
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:31,520
And this variable

462
00:20:31,760 --> 00:20:34,160
is often the turning point of the battle.

463
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:34,840
Seriously,

464
00:20:34,840 --> 00:20:36,320
why whenever Guo Zijian is mentioned,

465
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:37,920
it's about variables and uncertainties?

466
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:42,840
I also want to see

467
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:44,480
if Guo Zijian's judgment

468
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:45,360
can truly

469
00:20:45,360 --> 00:20:46,840
surpass the results of data analysis.

470
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:48,560
Alright, Staff Officer Liang.

471
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,520
Then hold on tight.

472
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:54,880
Report.

473
00:20:55,240 --> 00:20:55,760
Go ahead.

474
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:57,480
Hunting squad reporting.

475
00:20:57,800 --> 00:20:59,000
Captured five Red-beaked Birds.

476
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:01,200
They sneaked all the way here.

477
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:02,480
Word didn't get out, right?

478
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,880
We captured them the moment they woke up.

479
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,000
Their equipment wasn't even turned on yet.

480
00:21:06,120 --> 00:21:07,880
Wouldn't Red's recon losing contact

481
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:09,560
prove that something is going on here?

482
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:11,280
This area is huge.

483
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:13,080
They can't pinpoint the exact location,

484
00:21:13,520 --> 00:21:14,480
let alone determine

485
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:16,080
what kind of troops are actually here.

486
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:17,680
Indeed.

487
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:20,200
They don't have much time left.

488
00:21:20,840 --> 00:21:22,040
But for the Red side to think of

489
00:21:22,040 --> 00:21:23,640
West Wind Valley and Yellow Stone Ridge,

490
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:24,560
and send recon personnel there...

491
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:26,000
It seems this Suo Jian'an

492
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,160
knows his stuff.

493
00:21:27,600 --> 00:21:29,360
Playing chess against a master

494
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:30,440
is thrilling.

495
00:21:31,120 --> 00:21:33,240
If Suo Jian'an really were a lousy player,

496
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,200
this battle wouldn't be interesting.

497
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:37,080
But perhaps

498
00:21:38,360 --> 00:21:39,520
he still has a trick up his sleeve.

499
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:41,000
Political Commissar,

500
00:21:41,920 --> 00:21:45,200
how could you listen to Guo Zijian?

501
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:50,800
We can't let emotions dictate a war.

502
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:53,440
Anyway, Zeng Muhan and his team

503
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,360
don't have any tasks right now.

504
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,640
Letting them make the trip

505
00:21:55,760 --> 00:21:58,920
will at least give us peace of mind.

506
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:02,840
You're being too protective of Guo Zijian.

507
00:22:03,840 --> 00:22:05,920
Jian'an, you're Acting Brigade Commander.

508
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:09,240
I understand your pressure as a commander.

509
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:10,480
But I think

510
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:12,560
on some crucial issues,

511
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:14,880
you should handle things calmly.

512
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:15,920
First of all,

513
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,280
I admit

514
00:22:17,560 --> 00:22:20,200
I'm a bit annoyed with that kid.

515
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:21,320
But...

516
00:22:21,320 --> 00:22:22,040
But

517
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:27,920
you care too much about his attitude

518
00:22:28,280 --> 00:22:29,480
instead of his opinions.

519
00:22:33,360 --> 00:22:35,640
Political Commissar, you're my old boss.

520
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:37,600
I accept your criticism.

521
00:22:38,080 --> 00:22:40,040
I know since the exercise began,

522
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:41,640
you've been helping me build authority.

523
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:43,280
But think about it,

524
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,920
a major battle is imminent.

525
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:48,000
As a commander,

526
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:49,520
I can't afford to be indecisive.

527
00:22:49,720 --> 00:22:50,360
Besides,

528
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:53,360
I didn't completely ignore his opinions.

529
00:22:53,760 --> 00:22:54,160
Otherwise,

530
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:56,520
how could I change the plan last minute?

531
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:00,280
Section Chief Liu!

532
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:03,160
Here!

533
00:23:04,760 --> 00:23:06,120
Notify all offensive units.

534
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:09,280
All units must take battle positions!

535
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:10,040
Yes, sir!

536
00:23:18,520 --> 00:23:18,920
Battalion Commander

537
00:23:19,560 --> 00:23:21,680
Suo wants to secure Jade Emperor Peak,

538
00:23:22,040 --> 00:23:23,960
but has the 1st Battalion keep its plan.

539
00:23:24,600 --> 00:23:26,600
This sidelines the 1st Battalion.

540
00:23:27,040 --> 00:23:28,640
Notify the drones to search this area.

541
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:30,840
Guo Zijian's temperament,

542
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:31,960
does Deputy Brigade Commander Suo not know?

543
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:33,760
Putting him in his current position

544
00:23:34,040 --> 00:23:34,840
is the most appropriate choice.

545
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:37,800
Then having us stand by here,

546
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:39,000
what's the reasoning behind that?

547
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:44,200
At seven o'clock,

548
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:45,880
when the 1st Battalion fires first,

549
00:23:46,320 --> 00:23:49,120
we'll know if West Wind Valley is real.

550
00:23:50,760 --> 00:23:51,960
If that kid Guo Zijian actually

551
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:52,960
guesses right by some dumb luck,

552
00:23:53,560 --> 00:23:55,520
the Blue Army's main force is a mystery.

553
00:23:56,760 --> 00:23:58,440
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo knew this,

554
00:23:59,040 --> 00:24:01,280
so he moved the fight to Jade Emperor Peak.

555
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:03,680
But once they deploy at Jade Emperor Peak,

556
00:24:04,520 --> 00:24:06,800
the Blue Army will send reinforcements.

557
00:24:07,440 --> 00:24:08,400
When that time comes,

558
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:10,600
that's when our ace unit

559
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:12,600
will truly come into play.

560
00:24:13,960 --> 00:24:14,960
So that's why you said

561
00:24:15,040 --> 00:24:17,000
who is the main attack and who assists

562
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:17,800
isn't decided yet.

563
00:24:18,280 --> 00:24:19,080
Learn from this.

564
00:24:19,520 --> 00:24:20,080
Yes, sir.

565
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:25,000
Don't worry, Squad Leader.

566
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:27,440
Except for a few wild pheasants flying by

567
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:29,440
making ugly clucking noises,

568
00:24:29,800 --> 00:24:31,760
there hasn't been a single sound.

569
00:24:32,040 --> 00:24:33,000
Cut the crap.

570
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:34,440
Besides,

571
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:36,320
we already captured all five of their

572
00:24:36,320 --> 00:24:37,880
Red-beaked Birds just now.

573
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,080
I guess right now,

574
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:41,520
the Red Army command post is complaining

575
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:42,720
and why they aren't reporting back.

576
00:24:43,000 --> 00:24:44,400
If they don't go back,

577
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:47,000
it'll draw out their follow-up squads.

578
00:24:47,600 --> 00:24:49,080
Keep your eyes peeled, all of you.

579
00:24:49,640 --> 00:24:51,880
Why do you think the enemy was so sure

580
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:54,120
and just charged right at us?

581
00:24:57,080 --> 00:24:59,280
I can't explain it in just one sentence.

582
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:00,880
I get it.

583
00:25:02,320 --> 00:25:03,280
What do you get?

584
00:25:03,520 --> 00:25:05,520
That you don't get it either.

585
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:07,520
Are you asking for a beating?

586
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:09,880
Stay alert.

587
00:25:10,080 --> 00:25:10,480
Understood.

588
00:25:16,760 --> 00:25:17,240
Squad Leader.

589
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:18,640
We're here for reconnaissance.

590
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:19,840
And we've got a tail following us.

591
00:25:19,840 --> 00:25:20,720
If we get exposed,

592
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:21,920
it's our 1st Battalion that loses face.

593
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:24,160
Just keep quiet.

594
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:25,120
No, I mean,

595
00:25:25,360 --> 00:25:27,480
the Commander asked us to scout this area,

596
00:25:27,640 --> 00:25:29,240
but I don't see traces of the Blue Army.

597
00:25:29,640 --> 00:25:31,280
Would the traces be laid out for you?

598
00:25:31,560 --> 00:25:32,720
Don't we have to look for them?

599
00:25:33,320 --> 00:25:34,200
Shaolong, drive slower.

600
00:25:34,360 --> 00:25:34,760
Got it.

601
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:35,960
There's an intersection ahead.

602
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:38,160
There's a small road behind the village.

603
00:25:38,520 --> 00:25:38,920
Squad Leader,

604
00:25:39,360 --> 00:25:40,080
you're really amazing.

605
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:41,640
I almost missed it.

606
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,840
Your eyesight is incredible.

607
00:25:44,840 --> 00:25:46,880
Quit kissing ass and drive properly.

608
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,360
Everyone, be careful.

609
00:25:49,840 --> 00:25:51,000
There's something unusual about this road.

610
00:25:51,560 --> 00:25:52,040
Stop the car.

611
00:26:05,200 --> 00:26:05,720
Huzi.

612
00:26:06,320 --> 00:26:07,120
Look carefully.

613
00:26:10,800 --> 00:26:11,320
Squad Leader.

614
00:26:11,520 --> 00:26:12,520
The width of the road ahead

615
00:26:12,520 --> 00:26:13,840
is fine for our heavy equipment.

616
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,320
Okay, note it down.

617
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:16,720
Shunzi, log the coordinates.

618
00:26:20,440 --> 00:26:21,160
Mount up.

619
00:26:33,440 --> 00:26:34,000
Staff Officer Liang.

620
00:26:34,560 --> 00:26:36,160
The road ahead is pretty rough.

621
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,560
Average driving skills won't cut it.

622
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:39,560
You shouldn't follow us anymore.

623
00:26:40,160 --> 00:26:41,480
Who are you looking down on?

624
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:43,600
I'm not looking down on anyone.

625
00:26:43,840 --> 00:26:45,200
I'm just looking out for you guys.

626
00:26:45,560 --> 00:26:46,640
If our position gets exposed...

627
00:26:46,760 --> 00:26:47,440
Who takes the blame?

628
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:49,080
How about...

629
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:50,440
You guys just wait here.

630
00:26:50,800 --> 00:26:52,640
Maybe our main force will pass by here.

631
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:54,160
Then you can easily collect your evidence.

632
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:54,880
Right?

633
00:26:59,440 --> 00:27:01,920
Staff Officer Liang, they're provoking us.

634
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:03,280
I think he's right.

635
00:27:04,040 --> 00:27:04,880
If we encounter the enemy,

636
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:06,000
and give away their position...

637
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:06,760
Who takes the blame?

638
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:09,360
I don't think we need to follow them.

639
00:27:09,520 --> 00:27:10,720
We should keep an eye on Guo Zijian.

640
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:12,680
No, I have a feeling...

641
00:27:12,680 --> 00:27:14,080
We won't be disappointed this time.

642
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:19,200
Let's go. Drive.

643
00:27:19,360 --> 00:27:20,800
Staff Officer Liang.

644
00:27:21,360 --> 00:27:24,320
Then do you trust my driving skills?

645
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:25,920
Get out. Let me drive.

646
00:27:26,360 --> 00:27:28,600
I've had special tactical driving training.

647
00:27:30,080 --> 00:27:31,000
What are you waiting for? Hurry up.

648
00:27:31,120 --> 00:27:32,160
Otherwise, we'll lose them.

649
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:32,520
Yes!

650
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:34,680
I guarantee you on my Party loyalty

651
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:36,160
that as of right now,

652
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:38,240
Zeng Muhan hasn't made any contact with us.

653
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:39,960
Has your communication system...

654
00:27:40,280 --> 00:27:41,480
...been working properly this whole time?

655
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:42,440
It's working perfectly.

656
00:27:43,520 --> 00:27:45,400
The comms officer has been up all night.

657
00:27:45,800 --> 00:27:47,320
He's been staring at the radio all night.

658
00:27:47,560 --> 00:27:49,080
That area Guo Zijian was suspicious of...

659
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:50,160
What did he do about it?

660
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:53,760
Political Commissar,

661
00:27:54,280 --> 00:27:56,760
since he hasn't heard from Zeng Muhan,

662
00:27:57,520 --> 00:27:58,840
Guo Zijian had no choice

663
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:02,000
but to send the battalion recon squad.

664
00:28:04,800 --> 00:28:06,160
I knew he'd do that.

665
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:07,080
Any response?

666
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:08,840
None so far.

667
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:10,880
The situation is urgent now.

668
00:28:11,160 --> 00:28:12,400
Stop obsessing over that spot.

669
00:28:13,480 --> 00:28:14,000
Yes, sir.

670
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:29,800
Squad Leader, you guessed right.

671
00:28:30,040 --> 00:28:31,000
They really have reinforcements.

672
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:33,120
But they're too fast. What do we do?

673
00:28:34,040 --> 00:28:35,160
Orders from the command post.

674
00:28:35,320 --> 00:28:36,840
Let these scouts in.

675
00:28:37,040 --> 00:28:37,600
Take them all prisoner.

676
00:28:38,000 --> 00:28:38,920
Once they enter Second Slope,

677
00:28:39,120 --> 00:28:40,400
they'll reach our command post.

678
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:41,560
What are you afraid of?

679
00:28:42,280 --> 00:28:43,320
As soon as they enter the trap,

680
00:28:44,040 --> 00:28:46,120
we'll box them in and take them down.

681
00:28:50,560 --> 00:28:51,400
Listen up, everyone.

682
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:52,800
Get ready for combat.

683
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:54,480
Something's not right.

684
00:29:00,320 --> 00:29:01,920
Should we signal the Battalion Commander?

685
00:29:02,080 --> 00:29:02,800
Send what signal?

686
00:29:03,320 --> 00:29:04,760
Do you even know their positions?

687
00:29:05,080 --> 00:29:06,520
Their troop numbers or equipment?

688
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:08,360
You know nothing, so what would you send?

689
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:09,240
Understood.

690
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:10,960
If we misjudge the situation,

691
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:12,520
and mislead them, then what?

692
00:29:12,760 --> 00:29:14,080
Then what do we do, Squad Leader?

693
00:29:14,400 --> 00:29:15,400
What do we do?

694
00:29:15,760 --> 00:29:18,040
Huzi, no matter what happens,

695
00:29:18,240 --> 00:29:20,520
you and Shunzi just keep taking notes.

696
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:21,960
Yes, sir.

697
00:29:23,760 --> 00:29:25,480
But in this kind of terrain,

698
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:26,240
I'm afraid...

699
00:29:26,320 --> 00:29:27,040
Afraid of what?

700
00:29:27,760 --> 00:29:28,960
Even if you can't use a pen,

701
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:31,000
you have to cross-check using your brains

702
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:31,800
and memorize it firmly.

703
00:29:32,080 --> 00:29:32,840
Yes, sir.

704
00:29:40,640 --> 00:29:42,040
Staff Officer Liang, why did we stop?

705
00:29:43,520 --> 00:29:44,560
The Blue Force wants to take prisoners.

706
00:29:44,560 --> 00:29:45,720
Let's not get in their way.

707
00:29:46,360 --> 00:29:47,800
So this is the Blue Force's command post.

708
00:29:48,320 --> 00:29:49,280
We don't know yet.

709
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:51,440
Wu Dongsheng's team spotted it too.

710
00:29:58,680 --> 00:29:59,360
Hold on tight.

711
00:30:01,680 --> 00:30:03,080
Switch the lens to wide-angle.

712
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:04,520
Close-quarters combat is about to start.

713
00:30:04,520 --> 00:30:05,800
Pay attention. Don't miss any details.

714
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:06,880
Don't worry, Staff Officer Liang.

715
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:09,160
I'm the base's info-gathering champion.

716
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:11,400
Synchronize watches.

717
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:14,400
Combat time:

718
00:30:14,520 --> 00:30:16,640
June 6, 2017.

719
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:17,960
06:40.

720
00:30:21,040 --> 00:30:21,720
Roll call!

721
00:30:22,080 --> 00:30:23,080
1st Battalion, Guo Zijian!

722
00:30:23,120 --> 00:30:23,600
Here!

723
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,440
2nd Battalion, Jiang Shengqiang!

724
00:30:25,560 --> 00:30:26,160
Here!

725
00:30:58,760 --> 00:30:59,720
What's the deal with this road?

726
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:01,480
The Blue Force probably set it up.

727
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:03,080
To obstruct enemy vehicles,

728
00:31:03,240 --> 00:31:05,440
so they can't operate effectively inside.

729
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:06,880
No wonder they're the Crash Brigade.

730
00:31:07,280 --> 00:31:09,120
They'll make Wu Dongsheng's team crash.

731
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:22,760
Squad Leader.

732
00:31:22,760 --> 00:31:24,200
We're sneaking into the Blue Force's base?

733
00:31:26,760 --> 00:31:27,680
Isn't that perfect?

734
00:31:28,440 --> 00:31:30,040
Aren't we looking for their base?

735
00:31:33,320 --> 00:31:33,880
Huzi.

736
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:36,120
I'll say this one last time.

737
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:37,880
Record the battlefield elements.

738
00:31:38,240 --> 00:31:39,320
The key is the coordinates.

739
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:41,160
If you miss anything and mess things up,

740
00:31:41,520 --> 00:31:43,680
I'll rip your head off and kick it.

741
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:44,760
Yes, Squad Leader.

742
00:31:53,440 --> 00:31:54,840
Squad Leader, there's a roadblock ahead.

743
00:31:54,840 --> 00:31:56,600
Turn left, straight into Second Slope.

744
00:32:00,600 --> 00:32:01,240
Let me drive.

745
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:01,880
What?

746
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:03,440
Let me drive. You can't outdrive him.

747
00:32:03,560 --> 00:32:04,000
Hurry!

748
00:32:19,040 --> 00:32:20,360
Today, I'm going to see for myself

749
00:32:20,880 --> 00:32:21,960
just what the hell this Second Slope

750
00:32:22,600 --> 00:32:24,240
is actually hiding.

751
00:32:50,080 --> 00:32:51,480
Still no news from Wu Dongsheng?

752
00:32:51,600 --> 00:32:52,880
Sir, not yet.

753
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:55,760
Signalman!

754
00:32:56,000 --> 00:32:56,320
Sir!

755
00:32:56,320 --> 00:32:57,520
Get me Li Songwei from the 1st Company.

756
00:32:57,520 --> 00:32:58,080
Yes, sir.

757
00:33:00,880 --> 00:33:01,400
Copy that.

758
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:03,760
Prepare to attack Yellow Stone Ridge.

759
00:33:04,360 --> 00:33:05,360
Once the order is received,

760
00:33:05,560 --> 00:33:06,400
we move out immediately.

761
00:33:07,800 --> 00:33:08,240
Yes, sir.

762
00:33:16,360 --> 00:33:17,680
Staff Officer Liang,

763
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:19,200
we're here to gather information,

764
00:33:19,320 --> 00:33:20,520
not to pursue them.

765
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:21,640
The woods are so dense.

766
00:33:21,680 --> 00:33:22,880
If we don't follow closely,

767
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:24,480
you'll only end up filming leaves.

768
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:54,240
Squad leader, we lost them.

769
00:33:56,760 --> 00:33:58,720
That driving was awesome.

770
00:33:59,120 --> 00:34:01,560
I didn't expect Red to have such a pro.

771
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:03,440
Squad leader, are you okay?

772
00:34:03,800 --> 00:34:04,280
Shut up.

773
00:34:10,840 --> 00:34:12,560
Huzi, you guys go check the perimeter.

774
00:34:12,719 --> 00:34:13,600
Besides the tents,

775
00:34:13,840 --> 00:34:14,960
see if there are any equipment markings.

776
00:34:25,080 --> 00:34:25,719
Reporting, Squad Leader!

777
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:27,120
Tanks spotted ahead.

778
00:34:27,120 --> 00:34:28,679
Comms vehicles, command vehicles.

779
00:34:28,679 --> 00:34:29,920
All standard issue for a command post.

780
00:34:30,239 --> 00:34:31,960
Squad Leader, we did it!

781
00:34:31,960 --> 00:34:32,560
Beautiful!

782
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:33,639
Mission accomplished.

783
00:34:34,040 --> 00:34:35,159
Send the coordinates immediately.

784
00:34:36,320 --> 00:34:37,440
Squad Leader, watch out!

785
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:41,520
It's just an exercise.

786
00:34:41,520 --> 00:34:42,840
Is there a need to be so terrified?

787
00:34:54,560 --> 00:34:56,000
Let's see where you can run.

788
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:01,560
Remember these points.

789
00:35:02,280 --> 00:35:02,840
First.

790
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:05,520
The Blue Army will likely encircle us.

791
00:35:06,040 --> 00:35:07,200
Their route of encirclement

792
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:08,880
is exactly the route we just took.

793
00:35:10,600 --> 00:35:11,080
Second.

794
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:12,360
On both sides of the route,

795
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:14,600
they have heavy and jamming equipment.

796
00:35:17,520 --> 00:35:18,240
Third.

797
00:35:18,320 --> 00:35:20,760
I suspect the Blue Army's command post

798
00:35:21,080 --> 00:35:22,480
is located right in Second Slope.

799
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,200
Do you see the bushes behind us

800
00:35:26,280 --> 00:35:27,640
at our eight o'clock?

801
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:30,400
I'll drive over there in a moment.

802
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:32,440
You'll use the cover of the bushes

803
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:33,200
to jump out.

804
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:34,960
I'll drive on and lure them away.

805
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:37,160
Scatter as soon as you hit the ground.

806
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:38,800
Report to the Battalion Commander,

807
00:35:39,120 --> 00:35:39,960
then wait for rescue.

808
00:35:43,080 --> 00:35:44,680
Squad Leader, what about you?

809
00:35:45,280 --> 00:35:46,520
I'll probably spend

810
00:35:46,680 --> 00:35:48,720
the night at the Blue Army's camp.

811
00:35:49,080 --> 00:35:50,600
But as long as the mission is complete,

812
00:35:51,000 --> 00:35:52,560
being captured will be worth it.

813
00:35:53,200 --> 00:35:55,600
Remember, the coordinates and intel

814
00:35:55,840 --> 00:35:57,200
must be sent back no matter what.

815
00:36:06,240 --> 00:36:07,720
Why is Wu Dongsheng's team circling back?

816
00:36:08,040 --> 00:36:09,800
He must be looking for a new way out.

817
00:36:09,920 --> 00:36:11,000
There's no way out.

818
00:36:11,160 --> 00:36:12,920
The Blue Army's ground forces closed in.

819
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:18,920
Squad Leader, it's Long Yuanshan!

820
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:27,400
Jump!

821
00:36:33,840 --> 00:36:34,520
Squad Leader Hong,

822
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:36,960
Secure the scene. I'll track them.

823
00:36:37,240 --> 00:36:37,720
Yes, sir.

824
00:38:08,040 --> 00:38:09,040
Get out and save them!

825
00:38:09,160 --> 00:38:09,760
Save them!

826
00:38:14,440 --> 00:38:15,040
Save them!

827
00:38:15,040 --> 00:38:15,440
Save them!

828
00:38:29,040 --> 00:38:29,760
Remember,

829
00:38:30,200 --> 00:38:33,000
send the info back no matter what.

830
00:38:54,200 --> 00:38:55,240
Exercise Control, Exercise Control.

831
00:38:55,320 --> 00:38:56,200
This is Liang Hong.

832
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:57,480
There's been an accident here.

833
00:38:57,480 --> 00:38:58,440
We have injuries.

834
00:38:58,720 --> 00:39:00,960
Please send a rescue convoy immediately,

835
00:39:00,960 --> 00:39:02,160
along with military medics.

836
00:39:02,640 --> 00:39:03,880
Our location is

837
00:39:04,040 --> 00:39:05,680
the Blue Force position at Second Slope.

838
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:16,600
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

839
00:39:16,720 --> 00:39:18,920
All combat units are completely ready.

840
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:21,120
Will the suppressive fire launch on time?

841
00:39:27,920 --> 00:39:29,160
Reporting, Battalion Commander.

842
00:39:29,520 --> 00:39:31,560
Received coordinates from the scout squad.

843
00:39:31,800 --> 00:39:34,080
Second Slope at Yellow Stone Ridge

844
00:39:34,080 --> 00:39:36,200
is the Blue Force's command center.

845
00:39:36,200 --> 00:39:36,560
Beautiful!

846
00:39:36,560 --> 00:39:37,000
Beautiful!

847
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:37,440
Beautiful!

848
00:39:37,480 --> 00:39:37,920
Good.

849
00:39:41,640 --> 00:39:43,920
Old Guo, there is less than a minute

850
00:39:43,920 --> 00:39:45,040
before the main attack is launched.

851
00:39:45,040 --> 00:39:45,960
There's no time to adjust,

852
00:39:45,960 --> 00:39:47,320
let alone report to superiors.

853
00:39:47,640 --> 00:39:49,680
Tell me, what should we do?

854
00:39:50,160 --> 00:39:52,040
Then we execute Plan B.

855
00:39:53,040 --> 00:39:53,560
Deputy Battalion Commander!

856
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:54,360
Here!

857
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:55,280
Order immediately,

858
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:57,200
all our battalion's long-range firepower,

859
00:39:57,200 --> 00:39:58,840
except 2nd Company's support forces,

860
00:39:58,840 --> 00:40:00,600
to change trajectory and coordinates,

861
00:40:00,760 --> 00:40:01,960
and on the Yellow Stone Ridge area,

862
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:03,800
launch a saturation strike!

863
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:05,880
At the same time, the 1st Armored Company,

864
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:07,160
the 1st and 3rd Infantry Companies,

865
00:40:07,160 --> 00:40:08,320
the engineering and demolition units,

866
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:10,280
along with all assigned

867
00:40:10,280 --> 00:40:11,240
fire support from the Theater Army,

868
00:40:11,240 --> 00:40:12,400
will all deploy

869
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:14,760
and assault Yellow Stone Ridge!

870
00:40:14,760 --> 00:40:15,280
Yes!

871
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,040
Also,

872
00:40:16,800 --> 00:40:18,520
have 1st Company flank Yellow Stone Ridge

873
00:40:18,840 --> 00:40:21,360
and mop up their remaining forces.

874
00:40:21,560 --> 00:40:21,960
Yes!

875
00:40:22,480 --> 00:40:22,960
Staff Officer Hu!

876
00:40:22,960 --> 00:40:23,440
Here!

877
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:26,200
Draft a combat adjustment request at once.

878
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:26,640
Yes!

879
00:40:28,120 --> 00:40:29,240
The content is as follows.

880
00:40:29,560 --> 00:40:32,200
Our battalion, at 06:59 this morning,

881
00:40:32,200 --> 00:40:33,480
acquired accurate information,

882
00:40:33,600 --> 00:40:36,240
locating the Blue Force command post

883
00:40:36,280 --> 00:40:37,120
and their main forces' assembly area,

884
00:40:37,240 --> 00:40:39,800
with coordinates and force deployment.

885
00:40:40,200 --> 00:40:42,040
To achieve maximum combat effectiveness,

886
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:44,320
our battalion has adjusted its main forces

887
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:46,440
to strike the enemy at Yellow Stone Ridge.

888
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:48,600
Please handle accordingly,

889
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:50,480
and adjust the combat plan.

890
00:40:50,640 --> 00:40:53,120
396th Brigade 1st Battalion Commander Guo.

891
00:40:53,720 --> 00:40:57,200
Arrogant, simply arrogant!

892
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,360
If everyone acted like this,

893
00:40:58,480 --> 00:40:59,920
what's the point of having commanders?

894
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:05,080
True, his actions are inappropriate.

895
00:41:05,840 --> 00:41:08,040
But Old Suo, as commander-in-chief,

896
00:41:09,080 --> 00:41:10,360
you absolutely cannot lose your cool.

897
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:12,640
How can I not lose it, Political Commissar?

898
00:41:12,960 --> 00:41:13,960
Is this how things are done?

899
00:41:14,240 --> 00:41:15,800
The general offensive was about to start,

900
00:41:15,840 --> 00:41:18,320
and he changed the combat direction!

901
00:41:18,360 --> 00:41:20,520
Is this a joke? Child's play?

902
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:28,200
Old Suo, I have verified it.

903
00:41:28,560 --> 00:41:30,560
The 1st Battalion was one minute away

904
00:41:30,560 --> 00:41:31,480
when they received the information.

905
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:33,640
They submitted the request immediately.

906
00:41:33,640 --> 00:41:34,440
A request?

907
00:41:35,160 --> 00:41:37,240
Time was tight, so it's excusable.

908
00:41:37,360 --> 00:41:38,400
What does a request mean?

909
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:42,200
It means asking for a superior's consent.

910
00:41:42,760 --> 00:41:44,960
Did you approve it? Did I approve it?

911
00:41:45,600 --> 00:41:47,320
Oh, so he just goes his own way.

912
00:41:47,320 --> 00:41:48,720
No sense of organization or discipline!

913
00:41:49,440 --> 00:41:50,040
Yes.

914
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:51,720
You're right.

915
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:53,160
Under such circumstances,

916
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:54,880
as Party Committee Secretary,

917
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:56,040
I bear direct responsibility.

918
00:42:03,920 --> 00:42:04,960
At first, I also felt

919
00:42:05,400 --> 00:42:06,880
Guo Zijian's judgment wasn't unreasonable.

920
00:42:07,360 --> 00:42:09,480
However, his main attack direction

921
00:42:09,720 --> 00:42:11,800
was changed by you to a probing strike.

922
00:42:11,800 --> 00:42:12,360
So wouldn't striking

923
00:42:12,360 --> 00:42:14,040
Yellow Stone Ridge, with accurate info,

924
00:42:14,280 --> 00:42:15,280
be more effective?

925
00:42:15,280 --> 00:42:16,160
The problem is,

926
00:42:16,240 --> 00:42:18,800
we can't verify the info on the ridge now.

927
00:42:19,200 --> 00:42:21,200
What if it's another Blue Force trick?

928
00:42:21,760 --> 00:42:23,200
He'd not only be wasting firepower,

929
00:42:23,920 --> 00:42:27,760
he might also expose our position!

930
00:42:38,360 --> 00:42:40,640
Alright, let's stop arguing.

931
00:42:41,520 --> 00:42:43,600
The strike results will be out soon.

932
00:42:44,400 --> 00:42:44,920
Let's wait and see.
